  "title": {
   "en": "Momogusa-san ga Momogusa Sugiru!!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "桃草さんがものぐさすぎる!!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A cute romantic comedy about a housekeeper who takes care of Momogusa-san in various ways ♡\n\nSouji Hataki, an ordinary high school boy, ends up working part-time as a housekeeper at the house of Momogusa, the most beautiful girl in school!! Momogusa-san is a perfect girl who is talented at both academics and sports, but at home she becomes super lazy?!\n\nFor some reason, she grows fond of Hataki and lets her guard down around him enough to let him pamper her?!\n\nA flirty, romantic comedy about housekeeping for a lazy girl!!",
   "vi": "Chuyện tình chàng giúp việc và nàng lười!"
  },
